1. **3D Displacement Maps**: Implement WebGL-based displacement to make logos wrap realistically around curved surfaces (like mugs).
2. **Custom Text Fields**: Allow users to edit the contact info on business cards directly from the Mockup Generator page.
3. **Print-Ready Export**: Add an option to download high-DPI (300) versions of print assets.

